{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"La Fille et le Garçon (The Girl and the Boy)","Malina, une jeune immigrée iranienne, rend visite à Jean, dans son bel appartement du centre-ville. Elle veut savoir pourquoi son petit ami Denis, qui fait des travaux chez Jean, s'attarde après ses heures, jusqu'à prendre sa douche devant Paula, la femme de Jean. D'étape en étape, Jean et Paula vont apprendre à connaître Denis et Malina, glissant de la prostitution à l’amitié, de désirs inavoués à une affection plus sincère, de l’amour enfin à la famille, famille d’un genre nouveau, désir d’enfant compris. Dépassant épreuves et tabous, ce quatuor pose en grande liberté, charnelle et intellectuelle, les bases concrètes d’un nouvel idéal amoureux.",[4,5,6,7,8],"marriage","wealth","desire","sex","lgbtq",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":16,"filmType":20,"directors":21,"genre":30,"media":32,"synopsis":35,"production":37,"characters":40,"roles":63,"awards":82,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_131","fr2023-131-la-fille-et-le-garcon",{"native":14,"english":15},"La Fille et le Garçon","The Girl and the Boy",{"type":17,"date":18,"year":19},"Theatrical release","2023-06-21",2023,"Fiction film",[22],{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":29},"Jean-Marie Besset","jean-marie-besset",1959,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[31],"Romance",{"posterUrl":33,"trailerUrl":34},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/186/14/265914/format_page/la-fille-et-le-garcon.jpg","https://www.allocine.fr/video/player_gen_cmedia=19600966&cfilm=296285.html",{"native":2,"english":36},"",[38],{"country":28,"share":39},"Majority coproducer",[41,56],{"id":42,"film":11,"person":43,"age":49,"gender":47,"sexuality":50,"origin":51,"class":52,"profession":53,"ability":54,"assistedMobility":55},"FR2023_131_01",{"id":44,"slug":45,"name":44,"birthYear":46,"deathYear":26,"gender":47,"nationality":28,"awards":48},"